-- `voxel_size`: Optional scalar or $(3,)$ tensor defining voxel dimensions.
-- `grid_size`: Optional scalar or $(3,)$ tensor defining the number of voxels per dimension.
-- One of `voxel_size` or `grid_size` must be provided.
